    "/tools/{tool_name}/call": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Tool Call",
        "description": "Execute a tool and call someone with the result.\n\nThis endpoint is perfect for webhooks - it executes a tool (like WEATHER),\nthen places an outbound call to speak the result to the recipient.\n\nExamples:\n\nWeather alert call:\n```json\nPOST /tools/WEATHER/call\n{\n    \"tool\": \"WEATHER\",\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"prefix\": \"Good morning! Here's your weather update.\",\n    \"suffix\": \"Have a great day!\"\n}\n```\n\nScheduled weather call (from cron/Home Assistant):\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://sip-agent:8080/tools/WEATHER/call \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"tool\": \"WEATHER\", \"extension\": \"5551234567\"}'\n```\n\nDateTime announcement:\n```json\nPOST /tools/DATETIME/call\n{\n    \"tool\": \"DATETIME\",\n    \"params\": {\"format\": \"full\"},\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"prefix\": \"Attention please.\"\n}\n```\n\nWith callback for confirmation:\n```json\n{\n    \"tool\": \"WEATHER\",\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"callback_url\": \"https://example.com/webhook/weather-call-complete\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "tool_call_tools__tool_name__call_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "tool_name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Tool Name"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolCallRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolCallResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/tools/{tool_name}/execute": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Execute Tool",
        "description": "Execute a tool and optionally speak the result.\n\nThis endpoint allows external systems (webhooks, home automation, etc.)\nto trigger tool execution. The result can optionally be spoken to \nan active call.\n\nExamples:\n\nGet weather (just data):\n```json\nPOST /tools/WEATHER/execute\n{\"tool\": \"WEATHER\"}\n```\n\nGet weather and speak to call:\n```json\nPOST /tools/WEATHER/execute\n{\"tool\": \"WEATHER\", \"speak_result\": true}\n```\n\nExecute calculation:\n```json\nPOST /tools/CALC/execute\n{\"tool\": \"CALC\", \"params\": {\"expression\": \"25 * 4\"}}\n```\n\nSet a timer and announce it:\n```json\nPOST /tools/SET_TIMER/execute\n{\n    \"tool\": \"SET_TIMER\",\n    \"params\": {\"duration\": 300, \"message\": \"Pizza is ready!\"},\n    \"speak_result\": true\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "execute_tool_tools__tool_name__execute_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "tool_name",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Tool Name"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolExecuteRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolExecuteResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/speak": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Speak Message",
        "description": "Speak a message to the active call.\n\nThis is useful for external systems to inject announcements\ninto an ongoing call.\n\nQuery params:\n- message: The text to speak\n- call_id: Optional specific call ID (if multiple calls active)",
        "operationId": "speak_message_speak_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "message",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Message"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "call_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "title": "Call Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/schedule": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "List Scheduled Calls",
        "description": "List all scheduled calls.",
        "operationId": "list_scheduled_calls_schedule_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScheduledCallInfo"
                  },
                  "type": "array",
                  "title": "Response List Scheduled Calls Schedule Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Schedule Call",
        "description": "Schedule a call for a future time.\n\nYou can schedule a call with either a static message or a tool that\nwill be executed at call time (e.g., WEATHER for fresh data).\n\nTime can be specified as:\n- delay_seconds: Number of seconds from now\n- at_time: ISO datetime (2025-01-15T07:00:00) or HH:MM time (07:00)\n\nExamples:\n\nWake-up weather call in 8 hours:\n```json\n{\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"tool\": \"WEATHER\",\n    \"delay_seconds\": 28800,\n    \"prefix\": \"Good morning! Here's your weather.\"\n}\n```\n\nDaily 7am weather call:\n```json\n{\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"tool\": \"WEATHER\",\n    \"at_time\": \"07:00\",\n    \"timezone\": \"America/Los_Angeles\",\n    \"prefix\": \"Good morning!\",\n    \"recurring\": \"daily\"\n}\n```\n\nReminder call at specific time:\n```json\n{\n    \"extension\": \"5551234567\",\n    \"message\": \"This is your reminder to take your medication.\",\n    \"at_time\": \"2025-01-15T09:00:00\",\n    \"timezone\": \"America/New_York\"\n}\n```\n\nWeekday morning briefing:\n```json\n{\n    \"extension\": \"1001\",\n    \"tool\": \"WEATHER\",\n    \"at_time\": \"06:30\",\n    \"recurring\": \"weekdays\",\n    \"prefix\": \"Good morning! Time to wake up.\"\n}\n```",
        "operationId": "schedule_call_schedule_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScheduledCallRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScheduledCallResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
